          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On July 10th around 3 AM, a witness observed through their window a bright mass moving diagonally from North to East. Round or oval in shape and yellow in color, this object was observed for 10 to 15 minutes before disappearing. No noise was heard. This person likely observed the passage of a Transit or Oscar type satellite, rather than Skylab, which was no longer visible in France by the end of June.",
